{"sha": "00233de292ec1b0e881fedb94c938abda4db5d6b", "node_id": "C_kwDOBEmZvdoAKDAwMjMzZGUyOTJlYzFiMGU4ODFmZWRiOTRjOTM4YWJkYTRkYjVkNmI", "commit": {"author": {"name": "clarng", "email": "clarence.wyng@gmail.com", "date": "2022-09-20T17:09:26Z"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2022-09-20T17:09:26Z"}, "message": "[core] default memory threshold for release tests (#28640)\n\nNoticed that the release tests are using a lower memory threshold. This comes from Anyscale setting a specific value that can change based on what it needs. Anyscale recently made a change to respect the override that is set in the cluster env. This PR overrides the memory threshold so it will always use the value we set, regardless of what is set by Anyscale for its other clusters.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Clarence Ng <clarence.wyng@gmail.com>", "tree": {"sha": "fe3e7c5120fac23889b369eb7750f5f4f00292ea", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ray-project/ray/git/trees/fe3e7c5120fac23889b369eb7750f5f4f00292ea"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ray-project/ray/git/commits/00233de292ec1b0e881fedb94c938abda4db5d6b", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJjKfPGCRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAAi9MIAILawziM9TaNWnkSBEQeFnS/\nzomc4SgAF7vkeBNEPiQuDxIDLt1lSsWi56+/w5vr/Xoldhp3WRXCMBcdWj8/E1/I\nm+VDgbU7Fc+89GkYO05IM3vNQq4NVgzZmPYuBpCKTY/XdVOhaiU9SLncWbqzpeUm\nhnyRsvioR+FyJLh4Lhbxlm+0MPPjc8vePpkYlaQxCZ4OIbwxAFsnVd02oVg4BLmV\nWbh3ozPHIUC3OrhMWO7gcVz5pnAatjhka7qW6bhBbZt4ELACKdiQ0WXfIfrNfgAz\nNQ6Oxqpqb8iCEBaiMKl7iwKnOBsH7TKPzY+rFW0l9/2jkGZzZq7vRiPbYogGdfA=\n=weX/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree fe3e7c5120fac23889b369eb7750f5f4f00292ea\nparent e234f8a04239db13a1741677ccc9c4f40dab392f\nauthor clarng <clarence.wyng@gmail.com> 1663693766 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1663693766 +0100\n\n[core] default memory threshold for release tests (#28640)\n\nNoticed that the release tests are using a lower memory threshold. This comes from Anyscale setting a specific value that can change based on what it needs. Anyscale recently made a change to respect the override that is set in the cluster env. This PR overrides the memory threshold so it will always use the value we set, regardless of what is set by Anyscale for its other clusters.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Clarence Ng <clarence.wyng@gmail.com>", "verified_at": "2024-01-16T19:59:59Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ray-project/ray/commits/00233de292ec1b0e881fedb94c938abda4db5d6b", "html_url": "https://github.com/ray-project/ray/commit/00233de292ec1b0e881fedb94c938abda4db5d6b", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ray-project/ray/commits/00233de292ec1b0e881fedb94c938abda4db5d6b/comments", "author": {"login": "clarng", "id": 22830327, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIyODMwMzI3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22830327?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/clarng", "html_url": "https://github.com/clarng", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/clarng/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/clarng/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/clarng/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/clarng/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/clarng/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/clarng/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/clarng/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/clarng/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/clarng/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "committer": {"login": "web-flow", "id": 19864447, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow", "html_url": "https://githu